      "extract": "The ﬁrst suggestion of a relation between horizon and Navier-Stokes dynamics appears in the prescient thesis of Damour [3]. This work contains an expression now known as the Damour-Navier-Stokes equation [39] governing the geometric data on any null surface. Although tantalizingly similar, it is not quite the Navier-Stokes equation as it has too many variables (eliminated herein by an appropriate boundary condition)",
      "extractCut": true
